_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1978,"digest":"sha256:9ca77ac1f168fde6494bc9d70b0783b1efcfcb509ff3f99242ddfa4b9c1647f8","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-15T13:23:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T13:23:46Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.57.1/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.57.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.57.1","body":"# P01 correction — readable offline progress\n\nOffline preparation now keeps its current action, progress count and Stop waiting control visible on compact screens. The full optional-pack list is available in Offline verification details, while diagnostic output retains the complete original message.\n\nThe worker protocol, installation ownership, cancellation behavior and saved flights remain unchanged. This patch preserves the original v0.57.0 release and its public layout finding.\n\nExact game source: `4c85277ac7393eeeabab035387d4d4ae8734aba1`.\n\nAll six source gates passed locally and in both hosted source runs: 4,187 tests, zero failures, cancellations, skips or TODOs. Production reproduction/readiness and the ordinary build passed. Local browser checks cover the corrected portrait and short-landscape layouts, Standard and Large/Plain/Reduced preferences, real preparation, Stop/rejoin and cached Verify.\n\nThe frozen source archive matches all 4,884 tracked files and modes; every one of the 654 game files matches the original manifest. GitHub Pages/public verification is pending. P01 remains unaccepted until the corrective release and remaining loading-path browser checks pass. Browser emulation and modeled controller input are distinct from physical-device qualification.\n\nKnown P01 follow-up: Library export preparation and completion messages can appear below the visible viewport. This existing placement issue was confirmed separately and will receive a corrective release; P01 is not accepted by this patch.\n"}